{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/23bdbd43318751e6e7cc1344ce1357fc.webp?t=1759779882\" data-has-big width=800 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Bad Choices, Create Chaos!</strong><br> <br>Drink, stumble, steal, and smash your way through a world where bad decisions lead to the best stories. Lose control, unlock absurd antics, and turn your neighborhood into your personal playground - with or without your drinking buddies. <br><br><strong>Features</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd2a Do Stupid Things \u2013 Just because you can (and the drunker you are, the worse they get)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Multiplayer Mayhem \u2013 Wreak havoc with friends or drag them down with you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe0 Fully Open Map \u2013 Every house is enterable (invited or not).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd74 Survival Stats (Incl. BAC) \u2013 Because managing drunkenness is a skill</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udecb\ufe0f Interact with Everything \u2013 Move, use, or mess with almost any object</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf7b Character Customization \u2013 Create your perfect (or perfectly drunk) self</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 In-Game Economy \u2013 Earn, spend, and probably waste money</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad Drunken Expression \u2013 Dance, rant, or embrace chaos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf73 Drunk Cooking \u2013 Master the fine art of inebriated cuisine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/16304c31582b946b20f1893fc3179ce3.webp?t=1759779882\" data-has-big width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What You Can Do:</strong>  <br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/99164dc3e81f2aebf73a275a591993cb.webp?t=1759779882\" data-has-big width=800 height=44 /></span>Chug another beer and watch the world bend to your drunken logic.\u00a0The more you drink, the more stupid things you can do!  Raid a house and walk away with an entire barbecue grill\u2014if you can carry it, it's yours! Climb rooftops or ride a stolen shopping cart straight into trouble. Will you remember it tomorrow? Probably not. <br>  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/fc371fb296a0f9bf576628acf124aedc.webp?t=1759779882\" data-has-big width=800 height=44 /></span> Raid their fridge, crash their party or light the barbecue on fire at 3 a.m. See how long you can get away with it before someone calls the cop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/abf5bf04ecd11c28486d7cd19575fd71.webp?t=1759779882\" data-has-big width=800 height=44 /></span>You and your favorite drinking buddies can team up to turn every dumb idea into a shared disaster. Who needs plans when you\u2019ve got beer, bad judgement, and wingmen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/96dc7692403343b68e65c0c71f7b9aef.webp?t=1759779882\" data-has-big width=800 height=44 /></span>Sip a beer and casually prank your neighbors, or down moonshine and turn the entire town upside down. Whether you\u2019re a harmless drunk or a full-blown menace is up to you.\u00a0<br>    <br>   <br><strong>Will You Become a Local Legend?</strong>    <br>Wreak havoc, pull off legendary stunts, drive drunk, and make sure the NPCs never forget your drunken adventures. No consequences, no regrets\u2014just a whole lot of chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab a (virtual) drink, stumble into the unknown, and make a glorious mess in the ultimate sandbox of drunken stupidity!\u00a0 </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/c626a3587d63c881c9c674cb0116e414.avif?t=1759779882\" data-has-big width=800 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong> </strong><br>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3440390?t=1759779882","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3440390?t=1759779882","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/17ecf5e5d25017360f4813cd9a75c28b8a9f2273/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759779882","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/17ecf5e5d25017360f4813cd9a75c28b8a9f2273/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759779882","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Drunkard Simulator features depictions of alcohol consumption and intoxicated behavior, as well as some nudity and strong language."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea